Z||000019||Spyder||03-17-2000||12:49 PM||||Take a stick of butter and a cup of sugar,<BR>Pour sugar in a plate, roll butter in sugar, <BR>Walla a Butter Log.<BR>Cut into pieces and eat promptly.<BR>Also:<BR>I like a to go get a big spoon and a jar of mayonnaise and eat it straight from the jar.<BR>Then wash it down with a tall glass of vegetable oil. <BR>Just kidding,<P>Besides chicken and cheese nachos my favorite snack would be Buffalo Chicken Fingers!!!||||reg||1
